eftover test residue.","limitations":["Testing used UID 65534 as the unprivileged user rather than multiple named user accounts; mode 1777 and the direct write/deletion tests nevertheless provide strong evidence of the requested general behavior.","The lifecycle snapshot inventories /tmp but not /srv/drop, so retained proof files are established by the final executor command rather than independently inventoried by the lifecycle collector."]}
